    "text": "A body takes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math> to&nbsp;cool&nbsp;from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>61</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>59</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the temperature of the surroundings is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the time taken by the body to cool from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>51</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is:"
